        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The conservative movement often fails to communicate its support for the middle class and the poor effectively.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "My neighbors will not vote for me due to my pro-life stance and other policy positions.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
