    "turn_text": "it's important to society that there be some adults in the room who say, what would happen if we do this? If we could maximize growth, if we could maximize opportunity, can we do these things? Because the left functionally just wants to create magic money and subsidize things. And then you get inflation. Today, We got the updated inflation numbers for our community here. The Phoenix Scottsville area.",
